{
  "name": "Grant a Discord role to verified buyers with Discord OAuth2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Grant a Discord role to verified buyers\nThe buyer clicks the personal link from the welcome email, logs in with Discord, and the bot adds them to the server with the Supporter role.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Claim link clicked**: the token is hashed and looked up. A valid link redirects to Discord login (`identify` + `guilds.join`), with the token as `state`.\n2. **Discord callback**: the code is exchanged for a token and the Discord profile is read.\n3. The buyer row is linked to that Discord account. A second account cannot reuse the same link; the same account can retry safely.\n4. The bot adds the user to the server with the role (works even if they never joined), then grants the role again in case they were already a member.\n5. The buyer lands in the Supporters channel. If Discord refuses, they see a friendly page and the error workflow alerts you.\n\n### Setup\n- Discord app: add the callback URL as an OAuth2 redirect; invite the bot with Create Invite + Manage Roles, above the Supporter role.\n- Credentials: Postgres, Basic Auth (client ID / client secret), Discord Bot.\n- Fill in **Config**.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "76b42137-9753-49ce-8dc0-9ced99e5e00d",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -120
      ]
    },
